    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:included:99a97c3235059a06",
      "field": "included",
      "sourceTextSha256": "819f04fc9349c1f1d731b449ea2a2f16e0c05493c2405749b2d0ed7886816608",
      "text": "\tRound trip Mendoza–Puente de Inca: From the hotel, we’ll take you to our logistics center at Puente de Inca (190 km along a mountain road), where you can enjoy the spectacular scenery of the Central Andes. Return to the hotel included.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1HgcuwMUxK68f-s5379kXSQKF_OX9Y-Sx",
        "documentSha256": "7d0e77f248460d4856acd78ba4810982df618bae5589ea04f99e893251613982",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml#p0118",
            "textSha256": "3c343383612b381cc84d6ed10a5fbf86f23c49a35011313ab569a5603870ea11"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:included:69c8561f2850d1fe",
      "field": "included",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3a872fb572313a1dff8fed13b61963fdfbc9a5b805071e601e089a955f78d223",
      "text": "\tAll meals are included in the mountain. At Base Camps, meals are freshly prepared daily by our cooks using fresh ingredients. The diet includes fresh fruit, meat, chicken, vegetables, fresh eggs, pasta, bread, among others. We can provide this thanks to our own logistics system with refrigerated vehicles and storage infrastructure at camp (freezers and refrigerators).\n\n\tAt high camps, the guides prepare meals using the ingredients carried by the expedition, with specialized high-altitude stoves.",
